'''Legend? Check! Friends? Check!''' (Japanese: '''サトシとゴウ、ルギアでゴー！''' ''{{tt|Satoshi|Ash}} and {{tt|Go|Goh}}, Let's Go by Lugia!'') is the first chapter of the {{ma|Pokémon Journeys}} manga. It is based on the ''[[Pokémon Journeys: The Series]]'' episode ''[[JN002|Legend? Go! Friends? Go!]]''.

==Plot==
{{Incomplete plot}}

==Major events==
* {{Ash}} meets [[Chloe]], [[Professor Cerise]], and [[Goh]] for the first time.
* The [[Cerise Laboratory]] is officially opened in [[Vermilion City]].
* Professor Cerise appoints Ash and Goh as his [[Professor's assistant|research fellows]].

